1
00:00:04,394 --> 00:00:07,684
(Sheldon:)You know, in the future,
when we're disembodied brains in jars...

2
00:00:07,856 --> 00:00:11,396
(Sheldon:)...we're going to look back on this
as eight hours well wasted.

3
00:00:12,444 --> 00:00:16,904
I don't wanna be in a jar.
I want my brain in an android body.

4
00:00:17,073 --> 00:00:19,613
(Raj:)Eight feet tall and ripped.

5
00:00:20,493 --> 00:00:24,873
(Howard:)I'm with you. I just have to make sure
if I'm a synthetic human, I'd still be Jewish.

6
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:28,580
(Howard:)I promised my mother.

7
00:00:30,378 --> 00:00:34,758
(Raj:)I suppose you could have
your android penis circumcised.

8
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:39,140
(Raj:)That's something your rabbi would have
to discuss with the manufacturer.

9
00:00:39,596 --> 00:00:42,976
(Sheldon:)Not to mention
you'd have to power down on Saturdays.

10
00:00:44,476 --> 00:00:46,476
(Leonard:)Sheldon, why is this letter in the trash?

11
00:00:46,645 --> 00:00:48,475
(Sheldon:)Well, there's always the possibility...

12
00:00:48,647 --> 00:00:51,487
(Sheldon:)...that a trash can spontaneously
formed around the letter...

13
00:00:52,108 --> 00:00:55,528
...but Ockham's Razor would suggest
that someone threw it out.

14
00:00:55,695 --> 00:00:57,985
(Leonard:)It's from the Institute
for Experimental Physics.

15
00:00:58,156 --> 00:01:01,326
(Leonard:)They want us to present our
paper on the properties of supersolids...

